      "question": "Tell me the proportion of rejected US mortgage purchase records in 2025.",
      "ratio": "13.94",
      "text": "Within the defined US home-purchase records for 2025, the denial share is 13.94%: 607,818 denied records divided by 4,358,716 originated, approved-not-accepted and denied records. This is not every applicant’s rejection probability.",
      "passed": true
